<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρυό-εις</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span></b> , neut.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1291
				</span></i>
			: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of persons,
				<i>tearful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.506
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.323
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρυόεν γελάσασα</span> smiling
				<i>through tears,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.484
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>causing tears,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος, ἄλγεα, θάνατος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				5.737
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				227
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
